DESCRIPTION:The Path of Memory\, Between the Lands of Jasmine and Basil A cinematic journey documenting the dances of women in Al-Baha and Jazan\, highlighting an invisible heritage and preserving it from fading through images that safeguard memory for future generations. Version24 In total isolation\, a lonely programmer clings to his mother&rsquo\;s voice as a last refuge\, avoiding his fianc&eacute\; and sister &mdash\; until his illusion forces him to face his loss. The Scene Youssef Khalil's family clings to hope under the rubble of their former home\, trapped in a painful embrace as they wait for a rescue that may never come.
